  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "进程里已调用",
      "items": [
        "lifespan：initialize_database，并 subscribe EventBus → WS broadcast。",
        "POST/GET /api/projects → repositories.projects。不写 trace。",
        "emit()：SqliteTraceSink 先 INSERT，再 bus.publish。当前唯一调用方是 ModelGateway.generate。",
        "SkillRegistry 写 skills / skill_versions，并落盘 skills/generated/<key>/<version>/manifest.json。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "库在、路由不在",
      "items": [
        "Web 无 fetch、无 WebSocket 客户端。虚线只表示 CORS 允许 :5173。",
        "无 /api/skills，无 HTTP 调用 generate()。stepfun_local / stepfun_api 在 build_adapter 里直接 NotImplementedError。",
        "表已建但无写入方：chunks、knowledge_units、eval_cases、evaluation_runs。schema.sql 无 FTS。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Ops Lab 事实",
      "items": [
        "backend 不请求 mock-db。compose 只有 depends_on；mock-db 只提供 /health。",
        "F2/F3 改的是宿主 nginx.conf，再 reload。容器以只读卷挂载该文件。",
        "细图：docs/diagrams/ops-lab-topology.html。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Phase 3 虚线（未写）",
      "items": [
        "LocalHarness 将成为 generate() 的调用方。Control 与 Treatment 只差 SKILL.md。",
        "docker/nginx 走宿主 OpsLab adapter，不进沙箱。沙箱与 golden skill 见 phase3-runtime.html。",
        "C3.10 才会给 API 加 inject/reset/runs。今天仍是宿主脚本注入，curl :8088 验证。"
      ]
    }
  ]
